---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use React + TypeScript + Ant Design only
- Use pnpm as package manager

- No inline styles
- Use strict TypeScript
- Avoid eslint-disable comments 

- Each component should be in its own folder named after the component

- Split into files ONLY when needed:
  - index.tsx (component logic)
  - styles file (if styling is non-trivial)
  - constants file (if there are real constants)
  - utils file (if reusable logic exists)

- Prefer simple structure over over-engineering
- Do not create unnecessary files or abstractions
- Keep components small, readable, and reusable
